# `lib/` is the BUILD OUTPUT and is intentionally COMMITTED: `plugin_manager`'s
# install_bundle never runs a build, so DSH loads `exports["."] -> ./lib/index.js`
# straight off disk. Ignoring it would ship a package whose entry point does not
# exist on any machine but the author's.
# (Removed `lib/` here on 2026-09-30; see docs/ARCHITECTURE.md §5.)
